          <path d="M38 26 L54 26 L54 30 L38 30 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.5"/>
          <circle cx="64" cy="20" r="4.5" fill="#20F782"/>
        </g>
        <text x="250" y="33" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="42" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="-0.01em" fill="#FFFFFF">TWINTHOS</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════ 02 STORY ═══════════════════════ -->
<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-text">
        <p class="story-label">The problem</p>
        <h2 class="story-headline">
          <span class="word">Software</span>
          <span class="word">multiplied</span>
          <span class="word">.</span>
          <span class="word">Work</span>
          <span class="word">didn't</span>
          <span class="word">disappear</span>
          <span class="word">.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="story-body">Every team bought tools to make work easier. Each one created something new to check, update, chase, copy, book and follow up on. The operation didn't get simpler. It got heavier.</p>
        <p class="story-body">The work didn't go away. It changed shape. It became the quiet, constant background task that keeps good people busy and prevents them from doing the work they were hired for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-stat">
        <span class="story-stat-number">92%</span>
        <span class="story-stat-label">of companies plan to increase AI investment over 3 years — McKinsey</span>
        <div style="height:1px;background:var(--border);margin:var(--space-5) 0;"></div>
        <span class="story-stat-label">but</span>
        <span class="story-stat-number" style="font-size:32px;">only 1%</span>
        <span class="story-stat-label">of leaders call their company mature on AI deployment — McKinsey</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════ 03 ENEMY ═══════════════════════ -->
<section class="enemy" id="enemy">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="enemy-label">The enemy</p>
    <h2 class="enemy-headline">
      <span class="word">People</span>
      <span class="word">became</span>
      <span class="word">the</span>
      <span class="word">glue</span>
      <span class="word">between</span>
      <span class="word">systems</span>
      <span class="word">.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="enemy-chaos">
      <!-- Card 1: CHECK -->
      <div class="drag-card" data-d="0">
        <div class="card-tape" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/>
              <path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-label">Check</span>
          <span class="card-sub">Look it up. Read it. Confirm it.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 2: CHASE -->
      <div class="drag-card" data-d="1">
        <div class="card-tape card-tape--side" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 16c0-4 3-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/>
              <circle cx="18" cy="7" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
              <path d="M20 9l2 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-label">Chase</span>
          <span class="card-sub">Send again. Follow up. Wait.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 3: COPY -->
      <div class="drag-card" data-d="2">
        <div class="card-tape card-tape--side" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="8" y="6" width="10" height="13" rx="1"/>
              <path d="M4 10h12M4 14h12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-label">Copy</span>
          <span class="card-sub">Paste it here. Paste it there. Paste it again.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 4: UPDATE -->
      <div class="drag-card" data-d="3">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M11 4H4v12l9 6 9-6V4z"/>
              <path d="M11 4v6h6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-label">Update</span>
          <span class="card-sub">Change one system. Then change the other.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 5: BOOK -->
      <div class="drag-card" data-d="4">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="1"/>
              <path d="M3 9h18"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-label">Book</span>
          <span class="card-sub">Find the slot. Send the invite. Confirm it.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 6: FOLLOW UP -->
      <div class="drag-card" data-d="5">
        <div class="card-tape card-tape--top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 4l16 16"/>
              <circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/>
              <circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-label">Follow up</span>
          <span class="card-sub">One message becomes four.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 7: MOVE INFORMATION — the worst offender, on top -->
      <div class="drag-card" data-d="6" style="z-index:10;">
        <div class="card-tape" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="card-body card-body--wide">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-label">Move information</span>
          <span class="card-sub">From here. To there. Then back again.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════ 04 PROOF ═══════════════════════ -->
<section class="proof" id="proof">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="proof-label">The proof</p>
    <h2 class="proof-headline">
      <span class="word">Watch</span>
      <span class="word">work</span>
      <span class="word">disappear</span>
      <span class="word">.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="proof-intro">One workflow. No dashboard. No control panel.</p>

    <div class="proof-pipe">
      <div class="pipe-conduit" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="pipe-line"></div>
        <div class="pipe-particle"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="pipe-step" data-stagger-child="0">
        <div class="pipe-node">
          <span class="pipe-num">01</span>
          <span class="pipe-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipe-body">
          <span class="pipe-label">Enquiry</span>
          <span class="pipe-desc">A message arrives — email, form, enquiry. The workflow notices it.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pipe-step" data-stagger-child="1">
        <div class="pipe-node">
          <span class="pipe-num">02</span>
          <span class="pipe-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipe-body">
          <span class="pipe-label">Understand</span>
          <span class="pipe-desc">It reads what was sent. Works out what it means. Knows what to do next.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pipe-step" data-stagger-child="2">
        <div class="pipe-node">
          <span class="pipe-num">03</span>
          <span class="pipe-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipe-body">
          <span class="pipe-label">Check</span>
          <span class="pipe-desc">Looks across the systems. Confirms the details. Finds what's relevant.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pipe-step" data-stagger-child="3">
        <div class="pipe-node">
          <span class="pipe-num">04</span>
          <span class="pipe-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipe-body">
          <span class="pipe-label">Act</span>
          <span class="pipe-desc">Does what it's allowed to do — books, updates, sends, copies. Without asking.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pipe-step" data-stagger-child="4">
        <div class="pipe-node">
          <span class="pipe-num">05</span>
          <span class="pipe-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipe-body">
          <span class="pipe-label">Update</span>
          <span class="pipe-desc">Records are kept in sync. Nothing depends on someone remembering to copy it over.</span>
        </div>
