<!-- ═══════════════════════ 06 REDACTED ═══════════════════════ -->
<section class="redacted" id="redacted">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="redacted-label">Redacted example</p>
    <h2 class="redacted-headline reveal">
      <span class="word">A</span>
      <span class="word">real</span>
      <span class="word">audit</span>
      <span class="word">,</span>
      <span class="word">with</span>
      <span class="word">the</span>
      <span class="word">client</span>
      <span class="word">removed</span>
      <span class="word">.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="redacted-desc reveal">This is a real operations audit we ran. The client name and exact figures are removed. The structure, the findings and the recommended handover are intact.</p>
    <div class="redacted-grid">
      <div class="redacted-item" data-stagger-child="0">
        <div class="redacted-item-label">
          <span class="redacted-item-num">01</span>
          <span class="redacted-item-title">Workflow identified</span>
        </div>
        <p class="redacted-item-body">Enquiry-to-appointment process: a recurring operational sequence touching three systems, handled by two people across four steps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="redacted-item" data-stagger-child="1">
        <div class="redacted-item-label">
          <span class="redacted-item-num">02</span>
          <span class="redacted-item-title">Current manual process</span>
        </div>
        <p class="redacted-item-body">Someone checks for new enquiries, reads the details, copies information across systems, confirms the appointment, sends the reminder, updates the record. Six movements for one result.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="redacted-item" data-stagger-child="2">
        <div class="redacted-item-label">
          <span class="redacted-item-num">03</span>
          <span class="redacted-item-title">Recommended handover</span>
        </div>
        <p class="redacted-item-body">The enquiry-to-appointment sequence, with agreed rules for what Twinthos can do alone and what requires a person.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="redacted-item" data-stagger-child="3">
        <div class="redacted-item-label">
          <span class="redacted-item-num">04</span>
          <span class="redacted-item-title">Human boundary</span>
        </div>
        <p class="redacted-item-body">Twinthos handles the check, the copy, the update and the reminder. A person approves any appointment above the agreed value and any exception to the standard process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="redacted-item" data-stagger-child="4">
        <div class="redacted-item-label">
          <span class="redacted-item-num">05</span>
          <span class="redacted-item-title">Estimated value</span>
        </div>
        <p class="redacted-item-body">Based on the time usually spent on this workflow and the number of times it runs each week. The actual number is confirmed during the audit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="redacted-item" data-stagger-child="5">
        <div class="redacted-item-label">
          <span class="redacted-item-num">06</span>
          <span class="redacted-item-title">Implementation plan</span>
        </div>
        <p class="redacted-item-body">One workflow, one human boundary, a short setup window, then monitored operation. The plan specifies what is handed over first and what is left for later.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="redacted-cta-row">
      <a href="#offer" class="hero-cta">See the offer</a>
      <p class="redacted-cta-note">Full document available on request</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

